Root cause (line numbers at 6c50028a): the unlocked-lot Tổng TC branch
  ? revenue!.otherSell + revenue!.derived + ...
`receivableDetermined` (backend/src/services/debit-receivable-arming.ts:27) arms on
freightKnown OR ps≠0 OR opsCharge≠0 alone, so any lot priced by freight snapshots
but without qualifying trip_expense rows reaches the rollup with revenue ===
undefined → TypeError → whole board 500 for every role. Introduced in ab50b4c9
(the commit that created the service — verified `git show ab50b4c9:...` line 460).
The reference law in shipment-debit-summary.service.ts uses
`(revenue?.otherSell ?? 0) + (revenue?.derived ?? 0)`.
